      // wall   hit-wall-01                             (a wall bounce, rate-limited)
      // tick   click-percussive-01                         (the auto-tap countdown)
      // chain  harp-ascending-01       (a chain milestone)
      // gold   chime-bright-keys-01             (multiball, an emptied pocket)
      // blast  chime-warm-bright-01            (a bomb brick detonates)
